('SRC-PLAYER-POCKET-120','Player Pocket direct-competition and cross-VTT portability correction','project','project','PocketScroll Socket.IO bridge, Swipe v14.367, VTT Companion premium bridge, Diecast, Foundry mobile packages, Roll20 mobile characters, D&D Beyond mobile app, and two-VTT action-contract boundary','active','..\\PRODUCT_RESEARCH.md','2026-09-26','120 direct-competition/cross-VTT portability/payment correction pass','Broad mobile client demoted; reopen only for named multi-VTT failure and two-VTT pilot'),
