('D-146','market-selection','Demote Resolve Relay to a negative control and reusable protocol asset.','The exact package check finds current free target-aware modules covering most of the proposed paid workflow; reopen only for a named unmet system or table failure.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-RESOLVE-RELAY-105',NULL),
('D-147','market-product-boundary','Retain intent-envelope, stale-request, and idempotent-undo patterns without building Resolve Relay now.','These patterns remain useful for future permission-safe coordination, but they do not justify a standalone product while substitutes are strong.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-RESOLVE-RELAY-105',NULL),
