('D-149','market-product-boundary','Require TableLink to beat the exact free tunnel path and paid-host path before implementation.','A generic tunnel is already available; the proposed value is reliability, verification, reconnect, diagnostics, and safe fallback.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-TABLELINK-106',NULL),
