('D-151','security-selection','Require user-mediated provider credentials, short-lived invites, explicit bind approval, no payload inspection, and a kill switch.','A local connectivity utility must not silently expose a port, capture credentials, inspect game payloads, or leave an unbounded background gateway.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-TABLELINK-106',NULL),
