('D-154','market-product-boundary','Require direct comparison against Foundry Tunnel Manager, a phone or remote-player check, the exact free tunnel, and a managed host.','The buyer may obtain the same confidence for free or prefer managed hosting at every price.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-JOINPROOF-107',NULL),
('D-155','runtime-selection','Require an independent external probe and reject same-network-only green status.','NAT loopback can make a local check pass while real players fail, so the core claim needs an independent vantage or an explicit user-mediated remote check.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-JOINPROOF-107',NULL),
