('D-158','market-product-boundary','Retain false-green, stale-session, and minimal health-receipt patterns as reusable assets.','These patterns can improve a future reliability product without justifying a standalone verifier today.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-JOINPROOF-108',NULL),
('D-159','runtime-selection','Do not build JoinProof without an independent-vantage fixture and a named surviving failure.','Same-network checks can be falsely green and a probe service creates operating and privacy costs.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-JOINPROOF-108',NULL),
('D-160','market-selection','Continue the fresh search for a recurring payer problem after JoinProof demotion.','The current networking category is crowded and episodic; a recurring campaign failure may produce stronger product use and buyer value.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-JOINPROOF-108',NULL),
('D-161','market-selection','Open Session Pulse / Campaign Commitment as an eighth conditional challenger.','Recurring quorum and cancellation pain is ordinary and consequential, but the candidate must beat free scheduling and communication tools on the consequence-aware fallback workflow.','project','proposed','product-research','SRC-SESSION-PULSE-109',NULL),
