('SRC-TABLE-RESCUE-COMPETITION-164','Table Rescue direct competition correction','project','project','SessionFlow, premium side adventures, free one-shots, and manual fallback workflows','active','..\\PRODUCT_RESEARCH.md','2026-09-26','164 content and workflow competition correction','Party-size recovery must beat content and cancellation substitutes'),
('SRC-INJECTOR-V2-165','Dicebox Injector v2 reference','conversation','project','User-provided Dicebox Injector v2 design reference','active','C:\\Users\\rujie\\.codex\\attachments\\dcbe9006-a242-4e2c-9b66-c79231c78b4f\\Pasted text.txt','2026-09-26','165 verified transport design reference','Reference only; not an implementation instruction'),
