('O-444','certification','Verify first usable map boundary','A fake canvasReady hook is not enough to identify real usability.','Use exact fixture and explicit map/input observation.','GM/player map-usable and first-input evidence.','P0','open','runtime','SRC-STARTUP-IMPLEMENTATION-170'),
