('D-382','architecture','Keep the Star*Tup package standalone until the exact runtime adapter is ready.','The DiceBox checkout contains unrelated active changes; importing its package graph would weaken provenance and verification.','project','locked','runtime','SRC-STARTUP-FIXTURE-171',NULL),
('D-383','scope','Reuse existing DiceBox media, attestation, and FilePicker contracts only at their later compatible integration boundary.','M0â€“M2 have no asset or file operation to adapt, and inventing a second hash/file vocabulary would increase migration cost.','project','proposed','runtime','SRC-STARTUP-FIXTURE-171',NULL),
