('O-452','defect','Repair mining invisible click targets','All 24 mining Regions have Observer ownership but remain GAMEMASTER visibility; prior repair logic searched miningVein while live configuration uses miningDeposit.','Repair only Regions with enabled flags.regionwright-mining.miningDeposit to the Regionwright invisible-clickable contract, preserve mining state, then refresh placeables.','GM read-back plus real player click test showing ore artwork clickable with no visible Region outline.','P0','open','campaign-runtime','SRC-BLINGDENSTONE-LIVE-174'),
('O-453','implementation','Implement general exploration Region interactions','Many forage, salvage, discovery, creature-harvest, puzzle, and opportunity Regions lack an interaction behavior while their reward Items already have stable metadata.','Build a rerunnable exploration interaction injector keyed by stable map/Region/item IDs, excluding fishing and mining mechanical ownership.','Two-client player interaction receipts, one-time/reset-policy verification, inventory awards, and rerun preservation evidence.','P0','open','campaign-runtime','SRC-BLINGDENSTONE-LIVE-174'),
('O-454','reconciliation','Resolve Southeast and Southern hub destinations','Hub route Regions exist but Southeast and Southern destinations are not defined in the current 15-map network.','Choose explicit destination map/arrival Regions before attaching teleportToken behaviors; rescale the Southeast geometry to current hub art if retained.','Approved destination mapping and bidirectional teleport verification receipt.','P1','open','campaign-content','SRC-BLINGDENSTONE-LIVE-174'),
