('O-456','certification','Certify Gathering Contracts Journal deployment','The corrected Gathering Contracts injector exists and passes syntax validation, but this reconciliation has no runtime execution receipt.','Run the corrected injector, verify stable Journal/page IDs and content in the live world, then record deployment as live.','Journal/page read-back receipt with 11 expected pages and rerun preservation evidence.','P2','open','campaign-content','SRC-BLINGDENSTONE-LIVE-174');

INSERT OR REPLACE INTO kb_trials(trial_id,area,symptom,attempted_approach,failure_cause,correction,evidence_status,source_id) VALUES
('T-187','Underdark Region Levels','Players could not click exploration Regions; suspected Regions were attached to the wrong Scene Level.','Built a read-only 15-map Region Level diagnostic and compared explicit Region levels with initial/background Levels.','Hypothesis was false: zero wrong-Level Regions were found; many Regions instead lacked behaviors.','Do not move Regions as a blanket fix; diagnose behavior and interaction ownership separately.','Diagnostic complete; wrong-Level hypothesis rejected.','SRC-BLINGDENSTONE-LIVE-174'),
('T-188','Fishing/mining Region visibility','Making every Region GM-only removed player click targets for fishing/mining.','Copied the rest-point Region GAMEMASTER visibility/ownership semantics to all exploration Regions.','Regionwright fishing/mining click predicates require player Observer permission and maintain an invisible placeable hitbox; GM-only visibility defeats that interaction path.','Use module-specific invisible-clickable semantics for click Regions while keeping ordinary overlays GM-only.','Fishing live state corrected; mining still open.','SRC-BLINGDENSTONE-LIVE-174'),
('T-189','Foundry macro transfer','A repair macro was rejected with Unexpected identifier pathlib.','Python artifact-generation wrapper text was pasted into the Foundry Macro editor instead of only the generated JavaScript file contents.','Foundry Script Macros accept JavaScript, not the Python used to generate the artifact.','Distribute and paste only the generated .txt/.js macro contents beginning with the JavaScript IIFE.','Failure cause confirmed in console log; corrected artifact exists.','SRC-BLINGDENSTONE-LIVE-174');
