('O-458','reconciliation','Reconcile installed regionwright-mining 0.1.4 into durable project source','Resolved: the intended installed v0.1.4 files were promoted into durable project source before timing-puzzle implementation, with both the old v0.1.0 output and reconciled v0.1.4 baseline backed up.','No further source-drift repair is required for the v0.1.4 baseline; future deployment must originate from the reconciled v0.2.0 source.','Backups plus change audit showing only intended timing-puzzle files differ from the reconciled baseline.','P0','closed','runtime','SRC-MINING-TIMING-BUILD-178'),
