('F-875','mining',NULL,'Mining v0.3.0 serves nine ore difficulties and shared Gathering HUD integration','Foundry serves Regionwright Mining v0.3.0 and Regionwright Fishing v0.1.16. Mining contains nine mineable resources, seven ore timing profiles, ore-selectable local/remote no-write tests, and its Region control opens the shared Mining HUD tab. Fishing provides a tabbed Regionwright Gathering HUD with Fishing and Mining setup/test surfaces through the Mining public API.','project','safe_use','provisional','SRC-MINING-DIFFICULTY-HUD-BUILD-191',NULL,'mining,fishing,hud,difficulty,v0.3.0,v0.1.16,deployment');
