('F-876','mining',NULL,'High-tier ore timing profiles are faster','Very Rare Platinum uses 1100/950/800 ms; Exceptional Mithral 950/800/675; Legendary Hizagkuur 825/700/600; Legendary+ Arandur 750/625/525. Common through Rare retain their existing timing profiles and score geometry.','project','canonical','locked','SRC-MINING-HARDTIERS-193','F-872','mining,difficulty,timing,platinum,mithral,hizagkuur,arandur');
