('D-407','high-tier mining difficulty','Accelerate only Very Rare and higher ore pulse cycles while preserving the shared scoring geometry and lower-tier timing.','Live testing showed the top ore profiles remained too forgiving. Speed is the established difficulty control and avoids changing what each score means.','project','locked','user','SRC-MINING-HARDTIERS-193','Review after another tester pass.');
