('O-482','certification','Evaluate Hunting v0.3.3 tension curve','Automated tests cannot determine whether the nonlinear draw feels physically tense rather than sluggish.','Play several shots and tune full-draw duration or exponent if needed.','User live-play feedback.','P0','open','runtime','SRC-HUNTING-TENSION-215');-- Regionwright Hunting v0.3.4 heavy-bow resistance playtest 2026-10-04.
