('F-912','hunting-gathering',NULL,'Hunting v0.3.4 restores draw-marker pulses','The 50%, 75%, and 100% one-shot draw-marker pulses return because live play found them useful. The rejected four-stage placeholder bow art remains removed, and markers do not create discrete shot-quality tiers.','project','canonical','locked','SRC-HUNTING-HEAVYBOW-216',NULL,'regionwright,hunting,draw,markers,pulse'),
('F-913','hunting-gathering',NULL,'Hunting v0.3.4 uses increasing-force heavy-bow draw progression','Draw progression is modeled as constant player pulling power against a non-compound bow whose normalized force rises from 0.20 at the start of the power stroke to 1.0 at full draw. Full draw takes 2.5 seconds and exact continuous draw fraction feeds RK4 ballistics.','project','canonical','locked','SRC-HUNTING-HEAVYBOW-216','F-911','regionwright,hunting,draw,resistance,force,v0.3.4');
