('F-925','hunting-gathering',NULL,'Hunting v0.3.7 moving-quarry playtest is live','The live v0.3.7 build animates deterministic whitetail walks and stationary pause windows. Arrow-arrival quarry displacement is converted to physical lateral movement before hit classification, so moving shots require lead.','project','safe_use','provisional','SRC-HUNTING-MOVING-BUILD-223',NULL,'regionwright,hunting,movement,lead,v0.3.7'),
