('F-940','hunting-gathering',NULL,'Hunting v0.3.11 realistic-warbow model is live','The live v0.3.11 build uses T(s)=s^2 with a 2.5-second full draw, linear force fraction, stored-energy fraction s^2, and energy-derived launch speed. Full-draw speed remains 74.5 m/s / about 244 fps.','project','safe_use','provisional','SRC-HUNTING-WARBOW-BUILD-231',NULL,'regionwright,hunting,warbow,v0.3.11,playtest'),
('F-941','hunting-gathering',NULL,'Hunting v0.3.11 stamina consequence is documented','With stamina constants unchanged, the 2.5-second realistic draw leaves about 77.4 stamina from fresh and roughly 4.55 seconds of full-draw hold before exhaustion.','project','safe_use','provisional','SRC-HUNTING-WARBOW-BUILD-231',NULL,'regionwright,hunting,stamina,warbow,v0.3.11'),
