('O-502','implementation','Build Hunting v0.3.15 heavy-bow stamina feel','Current stamina hold is too generous for a heavy bow and positive draw pulses use warm colors while fatigue feedback is weak.','Implement 24/s full-draw drain, accelerating red stamina pulse, green draw milestones, test/build/deploy.','Regression tests, served runtime checks, and user live-play feedback.','P0','in_progress','runtime','SRC-HUNTING-STAMINAFEEL-238');-- Regionwright Hunting v0.3.15 heavy-bow stamina feel build/deploy checkpoint 2026-10-04.
