('F-988','hunting-gathering',NULL,'Hunting GM calibration uses switchable test modes','The Hunting GM HUD uses a bounded mode selector for ordinary Test Hunt, Live Trained Holdover, and Movement Calibration so calibration behavior can change without adding one-off launch buttons.','project','canonical','locked','SRC-HUNTING-TEST-MODES-253',NULL,'regionwright,hunting,testing,ui,calibration');
